  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2014/05/IMG_8313.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\">Un concurrido concurso de masterchef junior ha sido el acto central de la tarde de este jueves festivo en la Morer&iacute;a de Onda, que tambi&eacute;n ha contado con una demostraci&oacute;n canina, adem&aacute;s de encierro infantil, por la ma&ntilde;ana, y &#39;torr&aacute;&#39; de sardina nocturna.</span></span></p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/festesmoreria14dijousmasterchegossos/img_8283.jpg\" alt=\"img_8283\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/festesmoreria14dijousmasterchegossos/img_8284.jpg\" alt=\"img_8284\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/festesmoreria14dijousmasterchegossos/img_8285.jpg\" alt=\"img_8285\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/festesmoreria14dijousmasterchegossos/img_8286.jpg\" alt=\"img_8286\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/festesmoreria14dijousmasterchegossos/img_8287.jpg\" alt=\"img_8287\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/festesmoreria14dijousmasterchegossos/img_8288.jpg\" alt=\"img_8288\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/festesmoreria14dijousmasterchegossos/img_8289.jpg\" alt=\"img_8289\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/festesmoreria14dijousmasterchegossos/img_8290.jpg\" alt=\"img_8290\" styl